# Lure of the Wildcat (Windurst) (windurst 94): 736's reply kind. Ibwam has a script onTrigger (740), so an Event offer
# would alternate with it on a second talk in a row; 736 is a Progress event and plays again. The GM resets the quest
# (available, the badge taken) between the two offers.
lists WindurstWoods/Ibwam/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/736
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=-24,2.75,-59 job=WAR lvl=20
login
trigger Ibwam                             # 736
finish                                    # the badge; begun
quest Windurst.LureOfTheWildcat available
delkeyitem GreenSentinelBadge
trigger Ibwam                             # 736 again (Progress)
finish                                    # the badge; begun
